<title>LATVIA: DAUGAVPILS CHAIN TO MOVE TO OFFICIAL LIST.</title>
<headline>DAUGAVPILS CHAIN TO MOVE TO OFFICIAL LIST.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock exchange on Thursday said that Daugavpils Chain would move from the secondary list of the bourse to the official list from July 14.</p>
<p>&quot;This is the sixth company which has had its shares included in the bourse's official list,&quot; the stock exchange said in a statement.  </p>
<p>Daugavpils has been an active secondary market although it has settled around 1.10 lats level of late.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Lannin, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
